     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br><br>could you not simply modify renderUI, e.g. like<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">output$textInputs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    w </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> topiclabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    uis </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;list&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      uis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> textInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;TL&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Topic &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            </span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">character</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    uis<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Best Sigbert<br><br></div>"
    ]
   ]
