    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>thanks for your help :) Your code works very well for creating the input fields. But there is still another problem: For reasons that I can not understand, other reactive functions are not updating the texts at all.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>These are two relevant parts of ui.R:</div><div><br></div><div><div>  </div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">  tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&#39;Labels&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>             uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;textInputs&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">6</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    <br>    selectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;topic&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">numeric</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">colnames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">props</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>        selected </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span></div></code></div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>And these are from server.R: </div><div><br></div><div><div>  </div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">output$textInputs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    w </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ncol</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">props</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
