     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    uis </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;list&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      uis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> textInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;TL&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Topic &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                            value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">character</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    uis<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  tlabels </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$textInputs</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>  observe</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    updateSelectInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;topic&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> choices </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> tlabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                      selected</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tlabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()[</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><br></div><div>Typing something in the text fields does not change the selectInput choices. Do you know why?</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks and Best,</div><div>Carsten</div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br>On Wednesday, July 20, 2016 at 9:21:36 AM UTC+2, Sigbert Klinke wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br><br>could you not simply modify renderUI, e.g. like<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">output$textInputs </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> renderUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    w </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> topiclabels</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    uis </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vector</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;list&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> length</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>      uis</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]]</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> textInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;TL&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Topic &quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> <br>                            </span><span style=\"color:#000\">value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">character</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">w</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">i</span><span style=\"color:#660\">]))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    uis<br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br>Best Sigbert<br><br></div></blockquote></div></div>"
